WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
Walt Disney World, this is a shark bite.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.960
Cheeseburger spring rolls.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.640
If you know, you know.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.060
And if you haven't been to a shark
bite or even know what this is,

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.600
I'm on a mission to essentially
try every single theme park food

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.860
and give you guys my review.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.620
But these spring rolls
have become legendary.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.840
If you don't know what it
is, it is quite literally

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.280
cheeseburger inside of a spring roll

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.040
and it is served here at Magic Kingdom

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.000
at Walt Disney World in Orlando, Florida.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.120
Two of them, $9.50.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.620
It is a quick snack.

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:30.780
It's in the same realm as a
popcorn, a churro, a pretzel.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.880
You can get those things or
you can get a spring roll.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.180
Let's see how it is.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.720
Immediately, super crunchy on the outside.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:37.640
I don't know if you can hear it.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:38.920
You can hear it on my mic.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:39.940
Super crunchy.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.340
I'm just going for a bite.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.140
Let's go.

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.600
The outside, crispy.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.680
The inside, soft.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.520
It has all that ground beef inside.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.860
It's all ground beef.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.180
It seems like you get a little
bit of pickles in there.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:57.620
And you get a sauce.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:01.680
Inside, it feels like, imagine
you mashed up a Big Mac.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:03.820
Because it feels like Big Mac sauce.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:04.720
It feels like a hamburger.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:05.860
It feels like some pickles.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.760
It's like a typical cheeseburger taste.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:10.860
But it definitely has that
Big Mac kind of, like, flair.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.720
So imagine you almost,
like, chopped up a Big Mac

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:15.600
and put it inside a crispy spring roll.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.060
There is a sauce as well.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.040
A sauce comes with this.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.820
I will try it with the sauce and tell
you if it needs a sauce or if it doesn't.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.360
Wow.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.040
This is the snack of Magic Kingdom.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:30.680
And I think you're right.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.300
And not only that, I think it might
be the snack of all snacks in general.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:37.000
Because this is one of the best theme
park snacks that I've ever had, period.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:38.780
There is a pizza one as well.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.000
I'm not reviewing the pizza one as well.

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:42.280
They have a cheeseburger and a pizza one.

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:44.100
I will try it again one
more time with the sauce.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.380
How do I describe this sauce?

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:49.220
It's not spicy.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:55.680
This sauce almost adds, like,
a sweet kind of tang to it.

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:58.474
It's like a sweet tang
on top of that, like,

00:01:58.474 --> 00:02:01.040
typical Big Mac kind of
Thousand Island pickle

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:04.680
ground beef that's inside
the spring roll itself.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.120
I've been going back and forth.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.240
8.9, 9.1.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:09.920
Kess was on the money.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.260
I saw Kess in the chat saying 8.9.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:13.340
I'm going to bump it.

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:14.580
It's too good to go 8.9.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:15.780
I'll go 9.1.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.960
This is a 9.1 shark bite.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.280
One of the best theme park snacks, period.
